      "message": "[warning] Line 139: 🟡 `sinkId` identifies the video/rendering sink, not the participant itself, and can be recreated while the same call remains active. Including it in `areItemsTheSame` makes DiffUtil remove and reinsert the row on a sink change, losing RecyclerView state and causing avoidable animations. Compare only participant/call identity fields, or document why a sink change is intended to create a new row.",
